# speed_all_courses: every Speed Trax course, master, expert and novice with
# their bonus courses (all opened with the controller 2 code), each started,
# driven for five seconds and retired from the pause menu. The spare cars
# ($0DF8) are set back to 2 in each race so retiring never ends the game.
